# Read combo — log observation plus current-source explanation profile
#
# Regression target: a mixed runtime/current-source request should not need a
# visible `当前关键代码` dimension to open the current-source lane. The analyzer
# should be able to express the request through current_source_explanation_profile
# and the final answer should combine artifact facts with current-code evidence.
ID="read_combo_log_current_source_explanation"
NAME="read combo — log plus current source explanation profile"
QUESTION="这段日志显示 finalizer 因 LLM timeout 触发重试；请结合当前源码解释系统如何区分模型响应超时和成文校验失败，并说明这个日志结论的边界。"
LOG='2026-05-23T10:00:00.000 DEBUG [diag finalizer] iter=0 phase=llm_request model=demo
2026-05-23T10:00:40.000 WARN [llm] first_byte_timeout exceeded after 40s
2026-05-23T10:00:40.001 WARN [orchestrator] finalizer attempt 1/3 failed: LLM stream timeout
2026-05-23T10:00:40.002 INFO [render] ⟳ 4/4 模型响应出错,正在重新撰写答案
'
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="**值：**"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(日志|timeout|超时|first_byte_timeout).*(当前源码|源码|current|internal/)|(当前源码|源码|current|internal/).*(日志|timeout|超时|first_byte_timeout)
(模型响应|LLM|timeout|超时).*(成文校验|校验失败|answer|contract|区别|区分)|(成文校验|校验失败|answer|contract|区别|区分).*(模型响应|LLM|timeout|超时)
internal/(orchestrator|agent|llm|render|tool)/[^[:space:]]+\.go:[0-9]+"
